      {"type": "say", "line": "pebblit.ho_fame", "anim": "droop", "mood": "sad", "look": "bush", "next": "give"},
      {"id": "share", "type": "act", "actor": "pebblit", "anim": "eat", "mood": "happy", "text": "It grabs a berry in both stubby arms and eats the whole thing."},
      {"type": "say", "line": "pebblit.buono", "anim": "eat", "mood": "happy"},
      {"type": "say", "line": "pebblit.grazie", "anim": "nod", "mood": "happy"},
      {"type": "act", "actor": "pebblit", "anim": "look", "mood": "idle", "look": "milo", "text": "Then it stops and stares at Milo for a long moment, before scurrying under a rock."},
